  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till kvinnoorganisationer. Aktiviteterna str&#xe4;cker sig fr&#xe5;n       utbildning om kvinnors r&#xe4;ttigheter, internflyktingar, k&#xf6;nsbaserat     v&#xe5;ld till f&#xf6;retagsst&#xf6;d och politisk representation av kvinnor p&#xe5; b&#xe5;de lokal och nationell niv&#xe5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to women&apos;s organisations. Activities range from awareness     training of women&apos;s rights, IDPs, gender-based violence to business   support and political representation of women at both local and       national level.</narrative>
  </description>
